{#
  « Paiement » on the renter's tracking page (chantier #927, §2.4): from
  the moment the booking has a receivable, how to pay it — beneficiary,
  IBAN, the one communication, the amount due now and its deadline, and
  the SEPA QR of that transfer, enlargeable. The same block the manager
  reads on « Finances » (`@rental/_payment_details`), from the same
  service, so the two never disagree.

  Nothing here identifies anybody but the unit: the IBAN is the unit's
  own account, the one every renter is asked to pay into.

  Included from tracking.html.twig with one line, so the page around it
  stays whose it is. Requires `renter_payment`
  (RentalPaymentService::paymentInstructions(), or null).
#}
{% if renter_payment %}
    <div class="card mb-4" id="paiement">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Paiement</h2>
            {% if renter_payment.overpaid_cents > 0 %}
                <p class="mb-2" data-renter-payment-overpaid>
                    Vous avez versé {{ renter_payment.overpaid_cents|money_cents }} de plus que le montant
                    attendu : l'unité vous les rembourse par virement.
                </p>
            {% elseif renter_payment.amount_cents <= 0 %}
                <p class="mb-2" data-renter-payment-nothing-due>Aucun paiement n'est attendu pour l'instant.</p>
            {% else %}
                {% include '@rental/_payment_details.html.twig' with {
                    instructions: renter_payment, qr_dialog_id: 'qr-paiement', amount_label: 'À verser',
                } only %}
            {% endif %}
            <p class="small text-body-secondary mt-3 mb-0">
                Utilisez toujours la communication
                <span class="font-monospace text-nowrap">{{ renter_payment.communication }}</span>, pour
                l'acompte, le solde et la caution.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    {% if renter_payment.overpaid_cents <= 0 and renter_payment.qr_data_uri %}
        {% include '@rental/_payment_qr_dialog.html.twig' with {
            instructions: renter_payment, qr_dialog_id: 'qr-paiement',
        } only %}
        {# Keeps the screen awake while the enlarged QR is on it. #}
        <script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/payment-qr.js') }}" defer></script>
    {% endif %}
{% endif %}
